    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8jby5ca",
      "content": "Nutrition and Dietetics is the science of food and its relationship to health. It focuses on nutrients, balanced diet, metabolism, nutritional requirements, and prevention of deficiency diseases. In nursing competitive examinations such as RRB Nursing, important questions are frequently asked from nutrients, vitamins, minerals, balanced diet, malnutrition, and therapeutic diets."
    },
